{"id":"659714","name":"紫苏桃子","author":"鑫姐厨房","authorId":"8010602","desc":"","cover":"images/659714/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"桃子","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"紫苏","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"脆桃用盐把表皮毛洗净。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/2024062717194757697475018010602.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"紫苏洗净，只要叶子。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/2024062717194757770594688010602.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"桃子用刀切成大块，去核。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/2024062717194757850967198010602.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"加盐与白糖拌匀，腌半小时。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/2024062717194757884343318010602.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"紫苏加冰糖用手抓拌。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/2024062717194757937354258010602.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入奶锅中加水烧开。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/2024062717194758012638168010602.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入少许白醋，水立刻会变成粉红色。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/2024062717194758061795758010602.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":8,"desc":"把腌制好的桃子用洗水冲洗干净，放玻璃容器中。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/2024062717194758147697278010602.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":9,"desc":"把熬好的水倒入桃子上，没过桃子即可。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/2024062717194758206065858010602.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":10,"desc":"放冰箱冷藏一晚吃，更佳！风味独特的紫苏机子做好了！汤汁可以冲在气泡水中当饮品喝！","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/06/27/2024062717194758270485348010602.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"桃子尽量选太个脆的，不用去皮！最后放柠檬片可增加口感，也可以不放。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}